  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.7.0 (2026-06-19)\n\t\t  Added\n\t\t  - .NET 10.0 framework to the list of class library frameworks.\n\t\t  \n\t\t  Updated\n\t\t  - Target Framework Monikers (TFMs) of .NET 5.0, .NET 6.0, .NET 7.0, .NET 8.0 and .NET 9.0 to their proper values.\n\t\t  - Constant definitions NET50, NET60, NET70, NET80, NET90 to NET5_0, NET6_0, NET7_0, NET8_0 and NET9_0 respecitvely\n\n\t\t  1.6.0 (2026-06-19)\n\t\t  Added\n\t\t  - New enumeration value \"EnergyStorageSystem\" to enumeration \"EmcSG.SewPlus.Nems.Models.Reports.GenerationType\".\n\t\t  - New decimal property \"EndGeneration\" to class \"Emc.SewPlus.Nems.Models.Reports.Opr.Pen012Report\".\n\n\t\t  Updated\n\t\t  - All float properties to decimal in class \"Emc.SewPlus.Nems.Models.Submissions.SubmissionEntry\" and its corresponding complex type in XSD\n\t\t  - Version number in XSD namespaces from 4.9 to 4.10.\n\t\t  - Documentation in both XSD files and C# classes based on version 4.10 of the \"Data Services Specification for NEMS System\".\n\n\t\t  1.5.1 (2026-06-18)\n\t\t  Updated\n\t\t  - All instances of \"DateTime.MinValue\" to \"default(DateTime)\" in all \"EmcSG.SewPlus.Nems.Models.Reports\" classes.\n\t\t  - All \"<PropertyName>Specified\" \"DateTime\" related properties to use \"default(DateTime)\" for evaluation.\n\n\t\t  1.5.0 (2026-06-18)\n\t\t  Added\n\t\t  - XML file definitions of the EMC NEMS submissions based on version 4.9 of the \"Data Services Specification for NEMS System\".\n\n\t\t  1.4.2 (2025-05-26)\n\t\t  Updated\n\t\t  - Adhered report namespaces to namespace naming conventions.\n\n\t\t  1.4.1 (2025-05-22)\n\t\t  Updated\n\t\t  - Changed XSD namespaces from v4.6 to to v4.9 corresponding to version 4.9 of the \"Data Services Specification for NEMS System\".\n\n\t\t  1.4.0 (2024-12-07)\n\t\t  Added\n\t\t  - .NET 9.0 framework to the list of class library frameworks.\n\n\t\t  1.3.0 (2024-07-10)\n\t\t  Added\n\t\t  - New fields related to the TPC (Temporary Price Cap) Phase 2 enhancements to classes:\n\t\t\tEmc.SewPlus.Nems.Models.Reports.MCR.Mcr010Report\n\t\t\tEmc.SewPlus.Nems.Models.Reports.CWR.RealTimePrice\n\t\t\tEmc.SewPlus.Nems.Models.Reports.CWR.UsepDemandData.\n\n\t\t  1.2.0 (2024-07-10)\n\t\t  Added\n\t\t  - New properties to existing classes corresponding to the changes listed in version 4.6 of the \"Data Services Specification for NEMS System\".\n\n\t\t  ### Updated\n\t\t  - Namespaces from v4.3 to v4.6 corresponding to version 4.6 of the \"Data Services Specification for NEMS System\".\n\n\t\t  1.1.0 (2024-01-05)\n\t\t  Added\n\t\t  - Added .NET 8.0 framework to the list of class library frameworks.\n\n\t\t  Removed\n\t\t  - .NET Core 2.x frameworks from the list of class library frameworks.\n\n\t\t  1.0.0 (2022-10-16)\n\t\t  Added\n\t\t  - .NET 7.0 framework to the list of class library frameworks.\n\t\t  - XML file definitions of the EMC NEMS reports download based on version 4.3 of the \"Data Services Specification for NEMS System\".",
